cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "terrio: Pure-Rust geospatial raster, vector and point cloud data I/O"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
abstract: "terrio reads, writes, converts and reprojects geospatial raster, vector and point cloud data in pure Rust, without C dependencies, so it builds anywhere Rust does, including WebAssembly. It is available as a command line tool, a Rust library, a Python package and a JavaScript package, with an MCP server for AI agents."
